      "text": {
        "jp": "石碑に書いてあるのは……。\r\n「猛き者は剣をふるい、智ある者は魔法に通ず。\r\n賢者ならば、敵を見て、これを使い分けよ」だってさ。",
        "official_en": "This one says, “The mighty wield blades, the clever command magic. The wise must choose well—or face an end most tragic.”",
        "real_en": "The tablet says... 'The strong wield swords, and those with knowledge use magic. The wise choose between them according to the enemy.'"
